re`、Agent-local `PermissionDecider` 和 `OpenAiProvider.builder()` 路径。\n- 完成 Run/Turn/Attempt、branch/fork、可恢复 compaction、stale effect 拒绝、安全暂停恢复及 durable follow-up/steer queue。\n- Provider/Profile/credential、Workspace/Tool/Permission、Resources/Trust、Telemetry/Artifact/Export 已接入同一产品生命周期。\n- 固定 Pi oracle 扩展至九个领域；memory、JSONL、SQLite TCK 和 HostStore 故障注入通过。\n- 权威状态已更新至 [路线图](E:/Projects/Code/AI/Ji/docs/java-rewrite/10-roadmap-and-risks.md:71) 和 [设计索引](E:/Projects/Code/AI/Ji/docs/java-rewrite/README.md:7)。\n\n**提交**\n\n`e3fbb9cfee8b3c5f850a1a44453d60c618254497`  \n`feat(core)!: complete stage 2 Pi semantics`\n\n共 300 个文件，26,658 行新增、1,151 行删除。未 push、未创建 PR。\n\n**验证**\n\n- 提交后完整 `stage2Check`：122 tasks，全绿。\n- 阶段 0、阶段 1 全量回归：通过。\n- Windows 10 原生 workspace/path/junction smoke：通过。\n- Ubuntu 24.04 Linux smoke：通过，58 tasks。\n- macOS：`not_run`，非阶段 2 阻塞项。\n- 普通门禁未读取 `.env`、未调用真实 Provider、未记录 secret。\n- secret、私钥、绝对运行路径、冲突标记、旧 API 和 submodule gitlink 扫描：无命中。\n- 无残留 JI 进程、临时目录或本地容器。\n\n证据见 [verification-manifest.json](/export/user/.gold-band/projects/e-projects-code-ai-ji--a40d4379/tasks/task-015/runs/run-001/rounds/round-001/nodes/ai-dynamic/attempt-001/dynamic/nodes/phase-2-parallel-capabilities-merge/attempt-001/attachments/verification-manifest.json) 和 [protocol-trace.redacted.json](/export/user/.gold-band/projects/e-projects-code-ai-ji--a40d4379/tasks/task-015/runs/run-001/rounds/round-001/nodes/ai-dynamic/attempt-001/dynamic/nodes/phase-2-parallel-capabilities-merge/attempt-001/attachments/protocol-trace.redacted.json)。\n\n保留了用户原有的脏 `gold-band` 工作树、`.gold-band` runtime worktrees，以及 `stash@{0}`。真实 Provider RC smoke、真实 OAuth 注册、完整平台矩阵和部署地址属于后续阶段；本节点没有伪造这些结果。","startedSeq":107506,"endedSeq":108195,"startedAt":"1788492327Z","endedAt":"1788492338Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":15045,"revision":108195,"observedAt":"1788492338Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788477293Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788492338Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeT